# Generated config trees (closed-model and open-model/Tinker). The declarative
# spec in experiments/open_models/make_configs.py is the source of truth; these
# .yaml trees are build artifacts. Regenerate all of them with:
#   python experiments/open_models/make_configs.py
# (add --checkpoints ckpts.json to bake Tinker LoRA paths into the open SFT arms)
